# MeuJudi Sync source code is tracked (ignores inside the CS folder —
# node_modules, dist, etc. — live in the local .gitignore in meujudi-cs/).
# Installer releases (.exe/.blockmap) used to be committed here too, but
# since 30/07/2026 they live as Release assets in the dedicated repo
# MeuJudi/MeuJudi-Sync-Releases instead (download + autoUpdater feed).
# Already-tracked historical installers stay tracked regardless of this
# rule change — git only applies ignores to untracked files.
# Chaves privadas e credenciais locais nunca entram no Git.
meujudi-cs/*.private-key.pem
meujudi-cs/*.pem
meujudi-cs/.env*
!meujudi-cs/.env.example

# Root loose assets copied into public/
MeuJudi Icon.png
MeuJudi Logo *.png

